# --- ZETA RAYS Security: security tools (Debian repositories) ---
# Reconnaissance
nmap
whois
bind9-dnsutils
masscan
# Network
tcpdump
tshark
# Web
sqlmap
ffuf
gobuster
# Forensics
sleuthkit
foremost
